1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:03,815
Tonight, the moon shines round and bright.

2
00:00:03,815 --> 00:00:05,560
Beelu and his mother

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:08,173
walk hand in hand along the street.

4
00:00:08,173 --> 00:00:10,346
Wow, it's so lively!

5
00:00:10,716 --> 00:00:12,057
There are lantern floats

6
00:00:12,057 --> 00:00:13,195
and traditional performance floats,

7
00:00:13,195 --> 00:00:16,774
as well as bands playing drums and suonas.

8
00:00:17,745 --> 00:00:20,242
Beelu's dad is playing his suona as he walks

9
00:00:20,242 --> 00:00:22,924
right up beside Beelu.

10
00:00:22,924 --> 00:00:27,063
It turns out Beelu's dad is a band musician, too!

11
00:00:27,063 --> 00:00:29,364
Dad, you're amazing!

12
00:00:29,364 --> 00:00:31,745
Beelu, would you like to give it a try?

13
00:00:31,745 --> 00:00:33,820
Sure! I want to!

14
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:37,560
Dad hands Beelu an old suona.

15
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:38,751
Wow!

16
00:00:41,202 --> 00:00:46,358
A loud, powerful note from the suona

17
00:00:46,358 --> 00:00:52,046
sends everything nearby tumbling into chaos.

18
00:00:52,046 --> 00:00:53,322
Huh?

19
00:00:53,322 --> 00:00:55,040
Beelu suddenly realizes

20
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:57,859
he's in an unfamiliar place.

21
00:00:59,179 --> 00:01:01,306
Hey! There's a little kid here!

22
00:01:01,306 --> 00:01:02,901
How did you get here?

23
00:01:02,901 --> 00:01:04,173
Are you lost?

24
00:01:04,173 --> 00:01:05,895
Want to come play with us?

25
00:01:06,693 --> 00:01:10,208
Dad! Mom! Where are you?

26
00:01:10,208 --> 00:01:11,341
Move! Move!

27
00:01:11,341 --> 00:01:12,913
Watch where you're going!

28
00:01:12,913 --> 00:01:15,526
Suddenly, a little chick comes rushing by

29
00:01:15,526 --> 00:01:18,404
startling the animals and sending them scattering.

30
00:01:18,404 --> 00:01:20,051
Whoa!

31
00:01:20,621 --> 00:01:21,341
Wow!

32
00:01:21,341 --> 00:01:23,861
You're amazing! Thank you!

33
00:01:23,861 --> 00:01:26,508
They were blocking the road,

34
00:01:26,508 --> 00:01:28,057
so I only saved you because of that!

35
00:01:28,057 --> 00:01:28,624
Hmph!

36
00:01:30,797 --> 00:01:32,219
Inside the hall,

37
00:01:32,219 --> 00:01:34,473
the little chick looks around,

38
00:01:34,473 --> 00:01:36,450
here and there,

39
00:01:36,450 --> 00:01:38,693
wandering all over the place.

40
00:01:39,514 --> 00:01:42,034
What are you doing?

41
00:01:42,034 --> 00:01:43,630
I'm looking for something.

42
00:01:43,630 --> 00:01:45,179
I'll help you look!

43
00:01:47,456 --> 00:01:49,340
Are you looking for something tasty?

44
00:01:49,340 --> 00:01:50,924
The chick shakes his head.

45
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:54,878
Or are you looking for a lantern float?

46
00:01:54,878 --> 00:01:57,027
The chick shakes his head again.

47
00:01:59,791 --> 00:02:01,040
Wow! Look!

48
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,751
There are so many words written here!

49
00:02:02,751 --> 00:02:03,759
Huh?

50
00:02:03,759 --> 00:02:05,526
The table is too high.

51
00:02:05,526 --> 00:02:08,404
No matter how hard he tries, the chick can't see anything.

52
00:02:12,450 --> 00:02:14,485
Why isn't it here, either?

53
00:02:14,485 --> 00:02:15,988
What's missing?

54
00:02:15,988 --> 00:02:17,791
My story!

55
00:02:17,791 --> 00:02:19,392
What do you mean?

56
00:02:19,392 --> 00:02:21,595
I want to know who I am.

57
00:02:21,595 --> 00:02:24,531
I want to find my name and my memories.

58
00:02:24,531 --> 00:02:26,774
But I've searched for hundreds of years and still haven't found them!

59
00:02:27,849 --> 00:02:30,254
The chick wants to recover his memories,

60
00:02:30,254 --> 00:02:32,682
whether they're memories with his family,

61
00:02:32,682 --> 00:02:34,601
playing with friends,

62
00:02:34,601 --> 00:02:37,341
or painful memories that brought tears.

63
00:02:37,341 --> 00:02:39,606
He wants to find them all again.

64
00:02:42,208 --> 00:02:43,260
Ah!

65
00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:45,294
If you really can't remember,

66
00:02:45,294 --> 00:02:47,745
I'll be your friend.

67
00:02:47,745 --> 00:02:50,473
We can make happy memories together!

68
00:02:52,994 --> 00:02:54,633
Here we go!

69
00:02:54,633 --> 00:02:55,246
No!

70
00:02:58,219 --> 00:03:00,358
Hey, this instrument...

71
00:03:00,358 --> 00:03:03,098
The chick still can't remember anything.

72
00:03:03,098 --> 00:03:06,566
But their amazing journey is about to begin.

73
00:03:06,566 --> 00:03:09,491
The music carries them into the sky.

74
00:03:09,491 --> 00:03:14,312
All the animals stand on the musical score and play together.

75
00:03:14,312 --> 00:03:16,512
You're really good!

76
00:03:16,512 --> 00:03:17,745
Not at all!

77
00:03:18,369 --> 00:03:21,595
The music carries them across the sea.

78
00:03:21,595 --> 00:03:23,953
One sparkling light after another...

79
00:03:23,953 --> 00:03:25,890
...are the eyes of little squid.

80
00:03:25,890 --> 00:03:27,086
I caught one!

81
00:03:27,086 --> 00:03:28,971
Hmph! I can do that too!

82
00:03:29,734 --> 00:03:33,349
The music carries them to a lively street.

83
00:03:33,349 --> 00:03:35,005
It's so lively up ahead!

84
00:03:35,007 --> 00:03:36,716
Let's go take a look!

85
00:03:36,716 --> 00:03:37,653
Wait!

86
00:03:37,653 --> 00:03:39,052
Is that...?

87
00:03:39,052 --> 00:03:40,393
Oh no!

88
00:03:40,393 --> 00:03:43,129
There's a fight breaking out up ahead!

89
00:03:43,129 --> 00:03:44,878
Huh?

90
00:03:44,878 --> 00:03:46,558
The chick jumps out

91
00:03:46,558 --> 00:03:48,786
to shield Beelu.

92
00:03:48,786 --> 00:03:49,533
Hey!

93
00:03:50,127 --> 00:03:52,473
The chick's hair turns red,

94
00:03:52,473 --> 00:03:55,618
and his memories slowly return.

95
00:03:55,618 --> 00:03:58,878
Could these be... my memories?

96
00:03:58,878 --> 00:04:01,768
I remember! I remember!

97
00:04:01,768 --> 00:04:03,907
What did you say?

98
00:04:03,907 --> 00:04:05,778
Huh?

99
00:04:05,778 --> 00:04:07,930
Thank you!

100
00:04:07,930 --> 00:04:09,121
What?

101
00:04:09,121 --> 00:04:10,867
I can't hear you.

102
00:04:10,867 --> 00:04:16,474
Hey... hey!

103
00:04:18,543 --> 00:04:21,433
Beelu! Beelu, wake up!

104
00:04:21,433 --> 00:04:23,583
It's time to release the water lanterns!

105
00:04:23,583 --> 00:04:25,283
Mmm...

106
00:04:25,283 --> 00:04:28,034
Come on, it's our turn!

107
00:04:28,034 --> 00:04:29,583
Oh...

108
00:04:30,682 --> 00:04:33,306
Beelu and his parents

109
00:04:33,306 --> 00:04:37,341
send their water lantern floating far out to sea.

110
00:04:37,341 --> 00:04:40,463
But Beelu feels sad inside.

111
00:04:40,463 --> 00:04:43,803
He really wants to play with the little chick.

112
00:04:47,237 --> 00:04:49,410
Beelu, did you have fun today?

113
00:04:52,046 --> 00:04:53,410
his mother asks.

114
00:04:53,410 --> 00:04:55,872
But he doesn't answer.

115
00:04:55,872 --> 00:04:58,173
Seeing how down Beelu is,

116
00:04:58,173 --> 00:04:59,398
his father decides

117
00:04:59,398 --> 00:05:02,104
to tell him a secret.

118
00:05:02,106 --> 00:05:04,105
Beelu, did you know

119
00:05:04,105 --> 00:05:04,508
those water lanterns

120
00:05:04,508 --> 00:05:07,920
can become a path that we can't see?

121
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,560
If you look closely,

122
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:12,254
you might see friends we've lost.

123
00:05:12,254 --> 00:05:17,179
They'll follow the lantern light and come back to join us!

124
00:05:17,179 --> 00:05:19,664
Really?

125
00:05:19,664 --> 00:05:22,705
Beelu looks out across the distant sea.

126
00:05:22,705 --> 00:05:25,428
The little chick is waving to him.

127
00:05:25,428 --> 00:05:26,890
Thank you

128
00:05:26,890 --> 00:05:29,537
for helping me find my memories

129
00:05:29,537 --> 00:05:32,069
and make so many happy new ones!

130
00:05:34,033 --> 00:05:35,121
Look!

131
00:05:35,121 --> 00:05:37,537
The water lanterns are so beautiful.

132
00:05:37,537 --> 00:05:40,225
Yeah! I had such a great time today!
